#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:5 683b6806c4ec4a3a8e68c6f235ce059d
msgid "Getting Started with Rover"
msgstr "Rover 入门指南"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:7 99aecfc50e174424a62d4f0b50ee7f62
msgid ""
"To start with Rover, you will first need a rover with a :ref:`ArduPilot "
"compatible autopilot <common-autopilots>`. You can either select from a list"
" of :ref:`ready-to-drive vehicles<common-rtf>` or  assemble your own (See "
"below)."
msgstr ""
"要开始使用 Rover，您首先需要一辆配备 :ref:`ArduPilot 兼容自动驾驶仪 <common-autopilots>` 的车辆。您可以从 "
":ref:`即开即用车辆<common-rtf>` 列表中选择，或自行组装（见下文）。"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:14 cafbc316869e4b529e922d1d6842a7a3
msgid "Choosing a Ready-To-Drive Vehicle"
msgstr "选择即开即用车辆"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:16 b7ae4d913d0e43bf84f6d279bbd4bcd1
msgid ""
"Opting for a :ref:`ready-to-drive vehicle <common-rtf>` means you'll receive"
" a pre-configured and finely tuned rover that is prepared for its maiden "
"drive. To operate it, you will need to :ref:`install a ground station "
"<common-install-gcs>` and proceed to the :ref:`First Drive <rover-first-"
"drive>` instructions. Prior to operating, it is important to follow the "
"manufacturer's guidelines, especially related to safety."
msgstr ""
"选择 :ref:`即驱车辆 <common-rtf>` 意味着您将获得一辆已预先配置并精细调参、可直接进行首次驾驶的车辆。要操作它，您需要 "
":ref:`安装地面站 <common-install-gcs>` 并按照 :ref:`首次驾驶 <rover-first-drive>` "
"说明操作。使用前务必遵循制造商的指导方针，尤其是安全相关事项。"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:22 6b548ad9a5e64ba1879bcf3b3c963c53
msgid ""
"Regardless of using a pre-assembled or a Do-It-Yourself (DIY) vehicle, "
"remember that autonomous vehicles can pose hazards! It's critical to adhere "
"to recommended safety practices and pay attention to all safety warnings."
msgstr "无论使用预组装车辆还是自制（DIY）车辆，请务必记住自主车辆可能存在危险！严格遵守推荐的安全规程并注意所有安全警告至关重要。"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:25 e656e9ecdf314bbf9e7e79fc471acce5
msgid "Building Your Own Rover"
msgstr "自制 Rover"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:27 98ee0d8c3fea4980b67048747f6041da
msgid ""
"If you are interested in building your own rover, the following references "
"will guide you through the process:"
msgstr "若您有兴趣自制 Rover，以下参考资料将引导您完成整个过程："

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:29 4f3517356b5d4a75b44ad6b91d939c50
msgid ""
"Start by familiarizing yourself with :ref:`Selecting a Frame <selecting-a-"
"frame>` and :ref:`Choosing Hardware <choosing-hardware>` sections."
msgstr ""
"首先熟悉 :ref:`选择机架 <selecting-a-frame>` 和 :ref:`选择硬件 <choosing-hardware>` 章节。"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:30 1f07587162fc474ca076f12bce2e7bad
msgid ""
"Then, proceed to the :ref:`Select an Autopilot Board <common-autopilots>` "
"section to select an autopilot."
msgstr "然后，前往 :ref:`选择自动驾驶仪 <common-autopilots>` 章节选择一款自动驾驶仪。"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:31 7eaf2150d9e443afa85c802bf6cd85fe
msgid ""
"After choosing a frame, autopilot, and required hardware, :ref:`Pick a "
"Ground Control Station <common-choosing-a-ground-station>`."
msgstr "选定机架、自动驾驶仪和所需硬件后，:ref:`选择一款地面站 <common-choosing-a-ground-station>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:32 11c9362e2126415eb9ae2a6c38c26e78
msgid ""
"Navigate to :ref:`First Time Setup <apmrover-setup>` to begin the initial "
"setup."
msgstr "前往 :ref:`首次设置 <apmrover-setup>` 开始初始设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:33 80d0f3bc7788403a99146b46b8eea23e
msgid ""
"Finally, consult :ref:`First Drive and Tuning <rover-first-drive>` for "
"driving and tuning advice."
msgstr "最后，参阅 :ref:`首次驾驶与调参 <rover-first-drive>` 获取驾驶和调参建议。"
